      <div class="ns-line"><span class="ns-q">It's AI-proof because…</span><span class="ns-a">It runs on 25 years of shop-floor judgment AI doesn't have: knowing what a drawing is <em>missing</em>, what'll actually get built, and how to talk to machinists. AI speeds the grunt work. The experience is what they're paying for.</span></div>
      <div class="ns-line"><span class="ns-q">I'd do it anyway because…</span><span class="ns-a">I genuinely like untangling a mess and handing someone something clean they can use. I did it free for buddies for years.</span></div>
      <div class="ns-line"><span class="ns-q">My #1 opportunity is…</span><span class="ns-a">"2D-to-3D CAD conversion + work instructions" on Upwork. Saw 40+ open jobs, $45–$85/hr, low competition. Fastest to test.</span></div>
      <div class="ns-line"><span class="ns-q">My first move this week is…</span><span class="ns-a">Rewrite my Upwork profile around that one service and send 3 proposals.</span></div>
