        <div class="ns-by">Sample · "Lori," 54 · the passion path</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ns-line"><span class="ns-q">My direction is…</span><span class="ns-a">Teaching guitar to grown-up beginners (the over-40 crowd who always wanted to learn and figure they missed their shot) through a YouTube channel and an email list, with a beginner course down the road.</span></div>
      <div class="ns-line"><span class="ns-q">It's AI-proof because…</span><span class="ns-a">Beginners don't quit over bad information. That's free everywhere. They quit because nobody's in their corner. Being the patient, human voice that says "you're not too old, keep going" <em>is</em> the product. AI can't be that.</span></div>
