    <h3 class="sub">The Pressure's Off</h3>
    <p>One last thing, because I know what's nagging at you: <em>what if I pick wrong?</em></p>
    <p>You won't, because there's no permanent wrong here. This is a repeatable process, not a one-shot bet. If your direction dries up, or you get bored of it, or you just want a new challenge, you run the Compass again. There will always be a new in-demand opportunity waiting. That's the whole point of building this way instead of betting the house on a single hunch.</p>

    <div class="loop-card">
      <div class="loop-tag">Keep This</div>
