    </div>

    <div class="pull">You're not too old. You're just early to your next chapter.</div>

    <h3 class="sub">What's Next</h3>
    <p>Now you know <em>what.</em> The next thing you'll need is somewhere to build it, and someone to build it for. That's an audience you actually own: a newsletter. It's the one asset no algorithm, no layoff, and no AI can take from you, and it's where every direction in this workbook turns into income that compounds.</p>
    <p>But that's the next leg of the trip. For today, you did the hard part most people skip: you found your heading. The Golden Handcuffs Trap finally has a key in the lock.</p>

