      <div class="ap-text">I am <span class="ph" data-ph="age">[your age]</span> years old with the following skills: <span class="ph" data-ph="skills">[your skills]</span>; and this background: <span class="ph" data-ph="roles">[your roles]</span>. I want to create a 'build-once, sell-twice' digital product. Based on my background, give me 5 specific ideas for templates, guides, or mini-courses I could create. For each idea, tell me who the exact target customer is and what specific problem it solves for them.</div>
